.*
.* DSPJRN: a journal's entries; option 5 shows one in full. No golden:
.* the pub400 account owns no journal (title and keys).
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SEQCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CODECL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TIMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=JRN CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JRNLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LARGEST CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=SEQ CLASS=SEQCL.
:VAR NAME=CODE CLASS=CODECL.
:VAR NAME=TYPE CLASS=CODECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=JOB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TIME CLASS=TIMECL.
:VAR NAME=STAMP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=QJOB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MBR CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=COUNT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=CYCLE CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DATALEN CLASS=VALCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=ENTRIES VARS='OPT SEQ CODE TYPE OBJ OBJLIB JOB TIME STAMP QJOB MBR COUNT CYCLE DATALEN'.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/JEKEYS' NAME=JEKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPJRN KEYL=JEKEYS HELP=DSPJRN ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Journal Entries
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATACOL WIDTH=40.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JRN' VAR=JRN USAGE=OUTPUT.Journal
:DATACOL WIDTH=38.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/JRNLIB' VAR=JRNLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LARGEST' VAR=LARGEST USAGE=OUTPUT.Largest sequence number on this screen
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=ENTRIES.(No entries selected)
:LISTACT HELP='DSPJRN/OPTIONS' OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display entire entry
:LISTCOL HELP='DSPJRN/OPT' VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/SEQ' VAR=SEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Sequence
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/CODE' VAR=CODE USAGE=OUTPUT.Code
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/TYPE' VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJ' VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJLIB' VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/JOB' VAR=JOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/TIME' VAR=TIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT SEQ CODE TYPE OBJ OBJLIB JOB TIME'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPJRNE KEYL=JEKEYS HELP=DSPJRN ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Journal Entry
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SEQ' VAR=SEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Sequence
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CODE' VAR=CODE USAGE=OUTPUT.Code
:DATAI HELP='FLD/TYPE' VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OBJ' VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/OBJLIB' VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:DATAI HELP='FLD/MBR' VAR=MBR USAGE=OUTPUT.Member
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/QJOB' VAR=QJOB USAGE=OUTPUT.Job
:DATAI HELP='FLD/STAMP' VAR=STAMP USAGE=OUTPUT.Date and time
:DATAI HELP='FLD/COUNT' VAR=COUNT USAGE=OUTPUT.Count or relative record
:DATAI HELP='FLD/CYCLE' VAR=CYCLE USAGE=OUTPUT.Commit cycle
:DATAI HELP='FLD/DATALEN' VAR=DATALEN USAGE=OUTPUT.Entry specific data length
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPJRN.Display Journal Entries - Help
:P.The entries of a journal's receivers in sequence order, each with
its journal code and entry type, the object it is about, and the job
and time that wrote it. Option 5 shows an entry in full.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/JEKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JRN'.Journal
:P.The journal, by name and library.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JRNLIB'.Library
:P.The library shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LARGEST'.Largest sequence number on this screen
:P.The largest sequence number on this screen shown for what the display
is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPJRN/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SEQ'.Sequence
:P.The sequence of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CODE'.Code
:P.The code of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/TYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJ'.Object
:P.The object of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJLIB'.Library
:P.The library of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/JOB'.Job
:P.The job, by name, user and number. A job name alone is enough when
only one job has it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/TIME'.Time
:P.The time of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPJRN/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display entire entry
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display entire entry it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/MBR'.Member
:P.The member of the to-file that receives the data.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/QJOB'.Job
:P.The job, by name, user and number. A job name alone is enough when
only one job has it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/STAMP'.Date and time
:P.The date and time shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/COUNT'.Count or relative record
:P.The count or relative record shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CYCLE'.Commit cycle
:P.The commit cycle shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DATALEN'.Entry specific data length
:P.The entry specific data length shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
